OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 26 APR
OL,4,G1330FMusic Map
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch surveys the
OL,6,     Gmusical landscape surrounding JS
OL,7,     GBach's iconic Toccata and Fugue
OL,8,     GBWV 565. This tour-de-force is
OL,9,     Ginstantly recognisable - but is
OL,10,     Git even for organ?
OL,11,G1500FMusic Matters: Music on the Front
OL,12,     FLine
OL,13,     GClive Myrie is in conversation
OL,14,     Gwith news reporters. He and
OL,15,     Gphotojournalist Paul Conroy share
OL,16,     Gstories to reveal the power of
OL,17,     Gmusic when reporting from extreme
OL,18,     Gconflict situations.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
