OL,4,G1900FSunday Feature: Afterwords
OL,5,     GAn exploration of the trumpet
OL,6,     Gplayer, composer and conductor
OL,7,     GElgar - Gary - Howarth. Musical
OL,8,     Gcolleagues together with his son
OL,9,     GPatrick reflect on his
OL,10,     Ginternational achievements.
